        "created_at": "2023-02-21T02:01:55.840Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In EE there are certainly some cases where if a card leaves play it could have a lingering affect.  Like if Legacy gets incapped his Galvanize power is still in effect until the start of his next turn.  Still regarding EE, if Mr Fixer hits a target with Hoist Chain and it leaves play the -1 damage is still in effect until Mr Fixer’s next turn.</p>",
